cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Loomwerk
message: "If you use or build upon Loomwerk, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Winkler
    given-names: Thomas
repository-code: "https://github.com/GuideThomas/loomwerk"
abstract: >-
  Loomwerk is an open innovation engine: it breeds hypotheses from tensions in
  a user's own knowledge sources, selects them via a quality-diversity critic
  panel, learns the user's taste from their decisions, and matures surviving
  ideas into long-running threads.
keywords:
  - innovation-engine
  - quality-diversity
  - novelty-search
  - map-elites
  - knowledge-management
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-10-18"
